-- title: Telemetry read certificate expiring
-- description: The certificate for the telemetry read endpoint expires in under 14 days. Beacon cannot read the region.
-- severity: Medium
-- host: telemetry-read-svc.{wildcard_domain}
-- region: all
-- minimum_days_left: 14
-- timeout: 10
-- pending_for: 900
-- resolve_after: 1800
-- runbook_url: https://github.com/frappe/cargo/blob/develop/beacon/runbooks/service-certificate.md
-- Beacon reads the certificate that nginx serves. Beacon reads the ClickHouse of the region on this name. When it expires, the region is Unreachable and no rule runs.
